# The tracker is a long-running local process, not a 12-factor service — it has no
# env vars of its own. Runtime config lives in ~/.vibehub/config.json instead, written
# by `vibehub-tracker login <deviceToken>` (see docs/BUILD_PLAN.md §6, step 1) or by
# hand for local testing. Shape:
#
# {
#   "apiUrl": "http://localhost:4000",
#   "deviceToken": "<raw TrackerToken from server/prisma/seed.ts>",
#   "projectAliases": {
#     "client-acme-app": "a client project",
#     "some-secret-folder": "hidden"
#   },
#   "heartbeatIntervalMs": 30000,
#   "idleThresholdMs": 300000
# }
#
# See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §4.1 for the full contract.
